<title>UK: Rabobank sets 350 million mark four-year bond. [CORRECTED 08:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 350 million mark four-year bond. [CORRECTED 08:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND BA</p>
<p> AMT    350 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    30.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.86    PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p>(CORRECTS PAY DATE FROM 03.JUL.97)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.15	REOFFER    99.935    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT/AMST  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    =	   SELL CONC  1.525     LIST FEE    0.40</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND MAY 2001</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
